  "body": "Better than the Orewa Outlook. Just one minute down the road, people pull over, climb the steps and stand at The Outlook to take in the view. Here, you simply wake up to a better one.\r\n\r\nPerched above Hatfield Beach, this home captures one of the most spectacular views on the coast, gazing straight down the long golden curve of Orewa Beach and out across the gulf. It follows you from room to room. From the kitchen as the coffee brews, from the dining table as the sun sets, from the lounge as the lights of Orewa begin to sparkle, and from every one of the three bedrooms.\r\n\r\nTucked away and flanked by established gardens, it feels like your own private, secret haven. The master is a true retreat with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe. Downstairs, the games room makes a fabulous kids' retreat or home theatre, and a handy office nook means working from home comes with a view most could only dream of.\r\n\r\nThis is a comfortable home on a large site, and an opportunity to secure a position like this does not come along often.\r\n\r\nLife here is about slow mornings and barefoot walks along the sand. Wander the golden beaches of Orewa and Stanmore Bay, or cross the road to Eves Bush and its gorgeous native walks. Wenderholm Regional Park, with its beach and bush, is just 5 minutes away, and Orewa's boutique shops, cafes and everything else you need are only 5 minutes from your door.\r\n\r\nOthers stop to admire the view. You get to come home to it.\r\n\r\nAuction: Thursday 26 November 2026 at 12pm, Premium Takapuna Office (unless sold prior)",
